{"title":"A Visual Celebration of Miyazaki&#8217;s Weird Little Guys","link":"https://kottke.org/25/05/a-visual-celebration-of-miyazakis-weird-little-guys","date":1746813075000,"content":"\n        <p>A few weeks ago, I posted about <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/04/hundreds-of-free-images-from-studio-ghibli-films\">the hundreds of stills from their animated movies that Studio Ghibli has made available for free download</a>. Since I’m a big fan of <a href=\"https://www.vulture.com/article/miyazaki-weird-little-guys.html\">the weird little guys</a> director Hayao Miyazaki loves to put in his films (e.g. the kodama in Princess Mononoke<sup><a href=\"#fn:1746637548\">1</a></sup> and Spirited Away’s soot sprites), I thought it would be cool to pull some images from the Ghibli archive featuring these lovable little freaks.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-13.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-13.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-13.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-14.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-14.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-14.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-15.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-15.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-15.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-16.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-16.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-16.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-17.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-17.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-17.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-18.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-18.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-18.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-19.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-19.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-19.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-20.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-20.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-20.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p>And an honorable mention to this frame from Porco Rosso:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-21.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-21.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/studio-ghibli-free-21.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"811\" alt=\"a still from a Studio Ghibli movie featuring Miyazaki's weird little guys\" /></p>\n\n<p>The weird little guys category generally doesn’t apply to humans, but this image of little kids crawling all over a pig man’s airplane certainly classifies as an unusual swarm.</p>\n\n<ol><p><li>I bought a shirt with a kodama on it after seeing Princess Mononoke in 1999. At some point, I got rid of the shirt — why the hell did I do that?! It was very close to <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/listing/1216773576/vintage-1997-princess-mononoke-anime-t\">this shirt on Etsy</a> selling for $288…the collar/sleeve color was a dark blue or black on mine.<a href=\"#fnref:1746637548\">↩</a></li></p></ol>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Hayao%20Miyazaki\">Hayao Miyazaki</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/movies\">movies</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Studio%20Ghibli\">Studio Ghibli</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/05/a-visual-celebration-of-miyazakis-weird-little-guys\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"5258cd9c3e475684a0b41153d363958b4f34ccbc9c2f8c351739021210cd6d1a","category":"Sites"}